Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.79,0:02:34.38,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}プレ！　プレパラート！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.38,0:02:37.38,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}強くなんかないけど
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.76,0:02:40.51,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}プレ！　プレパレード！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.51,0:02:43.18,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}いつか君を捕まえる！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.44,0:03:01.20,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}油断したら　その指　チクチクアタック　覚悟して
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.49,0:03:07.16,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}小さいけど　挟むの　ミジンコみたいなアナタ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.62,0:03:11.58,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}欲しいのは　プラスチックなハート
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.62,0:03:13.58,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fs-2\fad(150,150)\pos(640,670)}プラス　プラス　ダケドマイナス
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.58,0:03:20.97,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}でもそれじゃつまらない　そこに気付いた者勝ち
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.76,0:03:26.68,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&H439AF4&}恋は甘くて　苦いもの
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.68,0:03:29.68,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&H4FBBD3&}単純明快　複雑怪奇な代物
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.77,0:03:32.65,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}どうでもいい事ばっかり気にしたりするの
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.81,0:03:35.69,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}どんな感じ？ソンな感じ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.69,0:03:38.69,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}温厚篤実　エキセントリックなアナタ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.82,0:03:41.70,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}強がる素振りを全身まとって太刀打ち
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.86,0:03:44.70,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}素直なだけだと刺激が強くて　クラクラ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.70,0:03:50.12,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}傷ついちゃうの　傷つけちゃうの　純情プレパラート
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:56.09,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&H5E47F0&}頭の中は　いつも一人の　純情プレパレード
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.79,0:02:34.38,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Pre!  Praparat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.38,0:02:37.38,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}我完全就不堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.76,0:02:40.51,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Pre!  Pre-Parade!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.51,0:02:43.18,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}我終究會把你攬入懷裡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.44,0:03:01.20,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}敢大意的話就做好覺悟  你的手指就會受到刺針般的攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.49,0:03:07.16,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}雖然你像水蚤一樣小隻  不過還是能夾起來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.62,0:03:11.58,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}想要的  是那顆塑膠內心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.62,0:03:13.58,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fs-2\fad(150,150)\pos(640,55)}Plus Plus  卻還是Minus
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.58,0:03:20.97,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}只是那樣是百般無聊  發現這點的就是贏家
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.76,0:03:26.68,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&H439AF4&}戀愛是甜蜜中夾帶苦澀的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.68,0:03:29.68,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&H4FBBD3&}是單純明快且複雜奇怪的玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.77,0:03:32.65,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}總會在意些無關重要的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.81,0:03:35.69,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}是什麼感覺？就是這種感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.69,0:03:38.69,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}溫厚老實且稀奇古怪的你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.82,0:03:41.70,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}硬要逞強不斷全力揮棒與我較量
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.86,0:03:44.70,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}你說自己很坦率  這個太過刺激讓你頭暈眼花
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.70,0:03:50.12,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}快要受傷了  快要傷害你了  純情的Praparat
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:56.09,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&H5E47F0&}腦海中一直只有一個人  純情的Pre-Parade
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.12,0:21:59.92,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}バニラソルトで Burning Love
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.13,0:22:07.51,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}アマいだけなら
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.80,0:22:12.56,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}ソルトかけましょう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.68,0:22:19.23,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}誰よりももっともっと私を
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.23,0:22:22.82,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}知って欲しいからさらけだしたい
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.82,0:22:26.11,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}でも出来ないの　経験Nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.11,0:22:27.78,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}モドカシすぎる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.86,0:22:34.83,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}でも、アマいだけの愛はちょっと
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.79,0:22:42.50,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}私が求めているモノとは違う
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.04,0:22:46.21,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}シロと言われたら
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.51,0:22:49.63,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}クロだって言っちゃう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.84,0:22:53.01,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}素直になれない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.43,0:22:55.39,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}アマノジャク
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.73,0:22:59.94,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}スキと言われたら
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.27,0:23:03.36,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}ダイキライだって
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.61,0:23:09.20,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}嬉しいのにナニ言ってんだろう?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.70,0:23:16.20,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}アマいバニラに
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.37,0:23:21.21,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}ソルトかけるよに…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.12,0:21:59.92,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}香草加點鹽  讓愛火燃燒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.13,0:22:07.51,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}如果只有甜味太過單調的話
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.80,0:22:12.56,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}就加一點鹽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.68,0:22:19.23,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}想讓你比起別人都能更加了解我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.23,0:22:22.82,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}所以想把自己的一切全盤展示出來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.82,0:22:26.11,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}但是我做不到  因為經驗是零
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.11,0:22:27.78,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}讓人看著心急
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.86,0:22:34.83,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}但是  甜蜜的愛情只有一點點
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.79,0:22:42.50,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}跟我追求的東西不一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.04,0:22:46.21,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}如果你說是白色
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.51,0:22:49.63,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}我就會說是黑色
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.84,0:22:53.01,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}無法變得坦率起來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.43,0:22:55.39,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}最喜歡鬧彆扭
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.73,0:22:59.94,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}你說喜歡我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.27,0:23:03.36,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}我就會回覆最討厭你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.61,0:23:09.20,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}明明內心很高興  我怎麼會說那些話
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.70,0:23:16.20,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}在甜甜的香草上
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.37,0:23:21.21,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}撒一點鹽吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.97,0:04:15.77,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(378,462)\pos(790,523)}大橋高校文化祭【後篇】
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.09,0:23:35.10,Title,,0,0,0,,{\4c&H5C5C5C&\pos(640,523)}幸福的掌中老虎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.73,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\shad0\fs35\c&H293339&\3c&H93D1F9&\b1\frz340.3\pos(561,459)}公演結束了{\c&H484CB4&}!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.54,0:00:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.47,0:00:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,都說別亂動
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.91,0:00:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我並不需要這種東西
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.96,0:00:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,這可是選美比賽
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.30,0:00:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是美麗的祭典
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.35,0:00:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你以為自己有多可愛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.30,0:00:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,大叔到頭來都沒趕上摔跤秀的公演
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.53,0:00:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,一直都在鼓勵大河的櫛枝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.70,0:00:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,也沒在後台露面
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是2-C嗎  還有20分鐘就要集合了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.84,0:00:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.38,0:00:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我還有司儀的準備工作
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.94,0:00:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,高須  服裝呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.79,0:00:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,這邊已經完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.36,0:00:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然只是在大河原有的衣服稍微改了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.74,0:00:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,這挺不錯的  高須
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.53,0:00:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.93,0:00:50.29,Comment,,0,0,0,,好可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.92,0:00:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,形象是…那個朱麗葉的裙子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.46,0:00:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(640,658)}Empire Silhouette
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.46,0:00:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,「帝國的剪影」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.22,0:00:57.29,Comment,,0,0,0,,柔和包裹的曲線
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.71,0:01:00.50,Comment,,0,0,0,,意境比較大  很浪漫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.59,0:00:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,高須  很危險
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.71,0:01:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,或許和他長相無關  很可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.45,0:01:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,還有一個小道具
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.85,0:01:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,大河  你要試穿一下…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.90,0:01:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你還在等你老爸嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.01,0:01:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,應該不會來了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.14,0:01:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我又不是在等他
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.75,0:01:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,反正他肯定是因為工作的原因遲到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.55,0:01:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我在想讓他買什麼東西來賠罪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.33,0:01:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,總之還是改一下你登場的台詞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.04,0:01:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不用改
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.68,0:01:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,就按照剛才商量的那樣說吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.37,0:01:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.24,0:01:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,川嶋  時間差不多了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起  我現在就過去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.15,0:01:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我說  真不用改嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.84,0:01:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你好煩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.14,0:01:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.16,0:01:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你說好就行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.83,0:01:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  什麼台詞啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.20,0:01:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.47,0:01:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多要換衣服了  高須也出去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.24,0:01:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.58,0:01:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,逢坂也是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.24,0:02:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,笑看朋友在受傷  對我來說絕對不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.80,0:02:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,大叔…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.10,0:02:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定會來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.79,0:02:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,無論有多晚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.74,0:02:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你都會飛奔過來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.81,0:02:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,作為一名父親就是這樣的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.39,0:04:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,讓大家久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.44,0:04:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,大橋高校小姐選美比賽  終於要開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.79,0:04:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,亞美也是  漁網漁網
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.29,0:04:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,漁網  漁網
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.89,0:04:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,漁網襪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.34,0:04:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,觀眾們安靜一點
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.25,0:04:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不安靜一點的話  就要懲罰了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.87,0:04:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不是叫你們安靜一點嗎  這群笨豬
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.47,0:04:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不會飛的豬  就只是單純的食用豬肉而已
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.75,0:04:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,開玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.75,0:04:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然那傢伙是司儀  不過卻想搶盡風頭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.20,0:04:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼我們開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.95,0:04:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,一號選手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.94,0:04:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,1年A班  光井百合子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.10,0:04:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,歡…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.96,0:05:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎回來  主…主人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.62,0:05:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,真是非常可愛的女僕
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.52,0:05:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,這身形象是維多利亞女僕嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.30,0:05:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.53,0:05:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.89,0:05:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,誰都沒聽她在說話
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.49,0:05:13.26,Comment,,0,0,0,,好了  那我們介紹下一位佳麗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.59,0:05:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,接下來也是一位擁有美麗笑容的女僕
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.89,0:05:18.46,Comment,,0,0,0,,二號佳麗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.66,0:05:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,簡訊?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.84,0:05:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,騙人的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.78,0:05:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,有件事想讓你轉告大河
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.10,0:05:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.52,0:05:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,因為工作的關係  我必須要離開一陣子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.21,0:05:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,發生了一點事情  再次跟她一起生活的事就當沒說過
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.57,0:05:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,幫我給公主道歉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.23,0:05:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.05,0:05:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.54,0:05:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,會相信他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.47,0:05:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.73,0:05:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,一直固執己見
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.71,0:05:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,這是一件好事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.60,0:05:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,必須要為大河加油
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.29,0:05:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.54,0:06:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,其實  或許是我內心的某處感到了寂寞
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.00,0:06:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,大河的父親出現了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.84,0:06:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,大河將要搬離遠去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.96,0:06:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想正視如此沒出息的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.54,0:06:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼情況
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.51,0:06:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,開什麼玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.25,0:06:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你說的沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.25,0:06:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,這一切…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.65,0:06:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,都是我任性的…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.67,0:06:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.53,0:06:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,高須  你沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.34,0:06:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,臉色不太好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.74,0:06:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,小高?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.24,0:06:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我要怎麼告訴大河才好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.32,0:06:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我用什麼表情去見大河才好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.71,0:06:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,讓大家久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.97,0:06:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,2年C班  說到掌中老虎大家都很熟悉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.01,0:06:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,有請  逢坂大河
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.22,0:07:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,騙人…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.17,0:07:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那是掌中老虎?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.36,0:07:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.03,0:07:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.97,0:07:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.14,0:07:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,今天很巧合…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.51,0:07:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,逢坂的父親有在現場為她聲援
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.82,0:07:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,在後台說的台詞是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.22,0:07:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,如果可以的話  這位父親
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.89,0:07:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,請讓我們聽聽你的聲援
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.24,0:07:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.78,0:07:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,或許沒來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.57,0:07:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,換下一個  換下一個出場吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.24,0:07:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,大…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.07,0:07:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我說…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.01,0:08:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,逢坂?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.26,0:08:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事吧  逢坂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.00,0:08:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,混混高須在給他的搭檔聲援
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.79,0:08:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但是掌中老虎確實很可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.96,0:08:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,很好  掌中老虎最強了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.62,0:08:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,但是非常笨手笨腳
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.41,0:08:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你老爸的事就別在意了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.20,0:08:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,最棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.05,0:08:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,等…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.37,0:09:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.12,0:09:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,父親什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.05,0:09:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,就拿去剁碎蒸熟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.72,0:09:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,扔到M…Morgue裡去!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.82,0:09:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,展示特長的時間
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.92,0:09:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  把那個拿過來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.33,0:09:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.95,0:09:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,拉上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.12,0:09:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.26,0:09:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,別提啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.24,0:09:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,打開
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.49,0:09:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.95,0:09:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我這種人…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.32,0:09:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼事都無法為她做
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.87,0:10:04.41,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正兰亭中黑_GBK\fs45\fsp3\bord0\c&H4E4948&\3c&H1C2A2F&\pos(650,378)}大橋高校小姐選美比賽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.86,0:10:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,今年的大橋小姐是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.09,0:10:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,御坂大河!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.48,0:10:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,老虎太厲害了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.50,0:10:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.10,0:10:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,接受到大家的祝福  她…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.03,0:10:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不對  不是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.56,0:10:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那傢伙不是孤零零一個嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.22,0:10:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,高須?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.48,0:10:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我必須要去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.24,0:10:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我必須要過去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.32,0:10:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然我可能不夠資格
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.51,0:10:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,即便如此!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.85,0:10:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.59,0:10:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好黑
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.77,0:10:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼情況
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.37,0:10:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,小的們
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.01,0:10:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,選美已經結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.86,0:10:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,現在輪到男士爭霸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.37,0:10:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,審查方法就是這個!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.06,0:10:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.福男
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.96,0:10:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.93,0:10:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,福男?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.06,0:10:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.89,0:10:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,操場上已經準備好賽道了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.24,0:11:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,總之給我跑起來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.79,0:11:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,第一的人就是男士爭霸的冠軍
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.63,0:11:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,文化祭還玩賽跑?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.26,0:11:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,完全沒幹勁
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.29,0:11:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,順便一說  我為福男準備的獎品是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.60,0:11:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,能為今年的大橋小姐佩戴頭冠並邀請跳舞的權利
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.18,0:11:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,還有我這三年來使用的全部學科的筆記
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.76,0:11:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,上課時的筆記和問題
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.59,0:11:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,全部考試的答案
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.70,0:11:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那位會長的筆記!?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.40,0:11:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,能跟老虎跳舞是真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.18,0:11:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不  不行的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.21,0:11:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好想要
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.40,0:11:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,大河
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.48,0:11:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我不需要獎品
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.57,0:11:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,跟福男沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.24,0:11:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,總之我無論使用什麼手段
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.00,0:11:48.81,Comment,,0,0,0,,大家注意別受傷了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.81,0:11:50.41,Comment,,0,0,0,,知道嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.69,0:11:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,要比任何人…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.14,0:11:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,比起任何東西…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.77,0:11:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,都要更快…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.57,0:11:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.81,0:11:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,躲開一點吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.71,0:11:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,混混
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.66,0:11:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,會被殺掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.95,0:11:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,各就各位
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.82,0:12:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,預備
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.76,0:12:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,趕到大河身邊!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.27,0:12:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,賽道是圍校園一圈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.39,0:12:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,跑起來  跑起來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.13,0:12:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,給我拚命跑起來!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.94,0:12:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,很好  幹掉高須了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.85,0:12:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.74,0:12:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,趁現在
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.61,0:12:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,那些傢伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.20,0:12:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我絕對不能輸!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.92,0:12:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,來了  來了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.85,0:12:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.01,0:12:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,高須復活了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.15,0:12:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,沒錯  我…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.69,0:12:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.33,0:12:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.31,0:12:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.44,0:13:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,真麻…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.03,0:13:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,煩!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.07,0:13:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,高須?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.71,0:13:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.41,0:13:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他是怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.71,0:13:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼要做到這種程度?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.26,0:13:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.99,0:13:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,裡面有很多原因  別管我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.43,0:13:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.43,0:13:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不能輸!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.06,0:13:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎麼躲開了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.35,0:13:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你不也是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.54,0:13:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,來了  來了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.55,0:13:35.04,Comment,,0,0,0,,領先人回來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.40,0:13:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.87,0:13:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.61,0:13:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,龍兒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.22,0:13:43.90,Comment,,0,0,0,,是高須
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.36,0:13:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.59,0:13:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,實…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.56,0:13:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,櫛枝?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.00,0:13:52.10,Comment,,0,0,0,,為什麼會有女生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.24,0:13:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,櫛枝?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.09,0:13:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.19,0:13:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,沒問題  女生也能參加
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.74,0:14:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你見到那個人時  有睜開眼看清楚嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.63,0:14:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你有看清楚嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.91,0:14:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,說得沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.51,0:14:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我完全沒看出來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.88,0:14:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,連每個月的生活費都只是匯款了事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,也不考慮大河的情況  任意帶她到處跑
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.60,0:14:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,連毀約的道歉也…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.41,0:14:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,只是給我發簡訊轉告
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.14,0:14:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他從一開始就沒考慮過大河
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.94,0:14:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,然後…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.76,0:14:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我竟然沒看出來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.18,0:14:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,真是個大笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.79,0:14:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,龍兒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.45,0:14:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,實乃梨
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.57,0:14:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.25,0:14:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,田徑社的…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.46,0:14:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,骨氣!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.22,0:14:53.99,Comment,,0,0,0,,櫛枝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.37,0:14:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你們這些傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.02,0:14:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你們幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.93,0:14:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣還算是男人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.65,0:14:57.90,Comment,,0,0,0,,櫛枝學姐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.56,0:14:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,請用這個
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.58,0:15:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.26,0:15:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,高須  快去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.98,0:15:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,為了大河  快去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.90,0:15:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.68,0:15:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,趁現在
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.24,0:15:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,同歸於盡  Attack
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.57,0:15:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,櫛…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.00,0:15:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.96,0:15:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,要比誰都要快
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.15,0:15:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,比我還要快
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.29,0:15:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,可以不用這樣擔心我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.60,0:15:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你們也看到吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.67,0:15:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,就算只有我自己也能振作起來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.75,0:15:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.67,0:16:02.92,Comment,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.02,0:16:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.42,0:16:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不用只在意我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.91,0:16:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.62,0:16:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我能自己振作起來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.11,0:16:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,能自己一個…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.12,0:16:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,生活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.94,0:16:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.07,0:16:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,班級展出節目  選美
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.12,0:16:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,還有福男!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.36,0:16:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,全部…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.45,0:16:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,都讓我們班級拿下了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.32,0:16:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,文化祭非常成功呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.61,0:16:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.22,0:16:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,會長最後的文化祭
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.61,0:17:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我能當這個學校的學生會會長  真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.44,0:17:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,能和你們在一起  真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.42,0:17:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我還有些雜事要處理
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.21,0:17:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你去享受吧  北村
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.78,0:17:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.22,0:17:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你是這次文化祭的最大功臣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.03,0:17:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.99,0:17:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,過去了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.86,0:17:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那種傢伙  打從一開始就無所謂
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.62,0:17:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,真的無所謂
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.54,0:17:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,但是  大河你…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.23,0:17:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,話說  你和實乃梨打得那麼火熱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.90,0:17:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是什麼時候和好的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.10,0:17:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你這傢伙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.47,0:17:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,實乃梨
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.30,0:17:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,大河  原來你在這裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.72,0:18:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,實乃梨  實乃梨  實乃梨
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.71,0:18:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,喜歡喜歡喜歡  最喜歡了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.46,0:18:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,是是  知道了知道了知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.81,0:18:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,大河  真可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.38,0:18:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,頭冠非常適合你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.73,0:18:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,這可是實乃梨幫我帶的頭冠
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.96,0:18:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,高須也有吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.89,0:18:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道  沒看到  聽不到
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.26,0:18:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋吉又在發情了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.62,0:18:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,亞美
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.20,0:18:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,亞美
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.83,0:18:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,請和我…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.88,0:18:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你要幹什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.64,0:18:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,正好是一年前
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.21,0:18:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,大河的父親也差不多像那樣出現了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.96,0:18:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我當時很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.09,0:18:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,希望他們能一起生活
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.49,0:18:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.01,0:18:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,果然也是像這次一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.27,0:18:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,她爸爸…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.72,0:18:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,突然間就消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.62,0:19:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起  高須
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.27,0:19:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,為…為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.24,0:19:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎麼想都應該是我來道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.00,0:19:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不  應該是我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.18,0:19:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我是知道她父親的本性卻沒告訴你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.92,0:19:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,大河什麼都沒跟我說
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.49,0:19:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的很珍惜大河
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.77,0:19:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我才…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.14,0:19:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,妒忌你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.66,0:19:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼她沒跟你說
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.82,0:19:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我一定會生氣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.19,0:19:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,大河不想別人覺得她爸爸是壞人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.23,0:19:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,所以從一年前的那天開始
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.69,0:19:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,大河就沒跟我說起她家裡的事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.34,0:19:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的  笨蛋吉跑到哪裡去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.56,0:19:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.22,0:20:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,逢坂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.14,0:20:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,一個人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.71,0:20:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,如果可以的話  能跟我跳個舞嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.73,0:20:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不行吧  我又不是福男
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.27,0:20:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,又來了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.57,0:20:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼北村…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.91,0:20:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,總是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.73,0:20:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,逢坂?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.39,0:20:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.02,0:20:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.30,0:20:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.47,0:20:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,要怎麼跳呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.85,0:20:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,牽起彼此的手心  相互凝視
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.05,0:20:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,然後跳掉厭倦為止
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.42,0:20:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.20,0:20:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我該不會是喜歡女生
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.88,0:20:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我會有這種想法
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.33,0:20:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我覺得如果不是就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.30,0:20:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,這也是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.65,0:21:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我能正常地說話
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.33,0:21:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,小高  你在做什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.76,0:21:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,真不合群  來和大家一起玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.27,0:21:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎麼說我們可是最強的班級
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.62,0:21:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.14,0:21:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,北村和大河也抓到了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.54,0:21:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,大家
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.64,0:21:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,大河
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.89,0:21:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好  在文化祭的夜晚裡…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.68,0:21:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,跳舞吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.35,0:21:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.65,0:21:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,這個夜晚是特別的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.92,0:21:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,把各種心情都拋之腦後
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.98,0:21:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然每次大聲歡笑  內心總會帶有一絲疼痛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.23,0:21:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,但是在這個夜晚結束後
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.50,0:21:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,一定…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.91,0:21:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,應該…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.26,0:21:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我覺得都會好起來的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.39,0:23:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,電視劇前的觀眾們  現在是命運的決鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.69,0:23:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我要發動究極魔法「幸福的掌中老虎傳說」
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.85,0:23:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼就會一直是我的回合
